# Text files are LF in the index and in every checkout (P101). The hash gates compare files on
# disk with committed hashes, and a CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf=true, the Git for Windows and
# Scoop default) made the four of them fail on an unchanged clone. Batch files stay CRLF for cmd.exe.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Treat binary asset formats as binary so line endings are never rewritten.
*.pdf binary
*.doc binary
*.docx binary
*.xls binary
*.xlsx binary
*.ppt binary
*.pptx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.skill binary
